      "lower": {
        "name": "Joaquin",
        "role": "Variantly"
      },
      "text": "Hi, I'm Joaquin. I design and build Variantly. Redesigning a site usually means betting on one direction. If it's wrong, you start over. Variantly is for developers who already use a coding agent, and for designers exploring directions. Your agent builds several complete redesigns at once, each one running as your real site, and you keep the one you like.",
