      "step": "Why",
      "card": {
        "kind": "learn",
        "title": "In this video",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Set up a run",
            "on": "set"
          },
          {
            "text": "Give each variant its own direction",
            "on": "direction,"
          },
          {
            "text": "Compare them on your real site",
            "on": "compare"
          },
          {
            "text": "Keep one, for the whole site",
            "on": "keep"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "In this video, you'll learn how to set up a run, give each variant its own direction, compare the results on your real site, and keep one. By the end, you'll have ten redesigns of a real site, and one of them applied.",
