      "text": "First, the mental model. Your project stays exactly where it is. Each variant is a separate copy, an isolated git worktree, with its own preview server. You compare the previews side by side. You keep one. And one last pass rolls it out to the rest of the site.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "wait": 300
        }
