      "text": "You need two things: Node, and a coding agent you already use. In your project folder, run npx variantly. It opens a wizard in your browser. The design work is done by Impeccable, an open-source design skill for coding agents. If your agent doesn't have it yet, Variantly installs it in one click. One thing to watch: it has to be the command-line agent. Browser builders like Lovable or Bolt can't run on your machine.",
